{"seq":2,"slug":"consistency-regularization","title":"一致性正则：预测应对扰动免疫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/methods/consistency-regularization","wordCount":1699,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"一致性正则-预测应对扰动免疫\">一致性正则：预测应对扰动免疫</h1><p>伪标签靠「造标签」利用无标签数据，一致性正则走的是完全相反的哲学：它一个标签都不造，只提一个要求——把同一个样本轻轻扰动一下，模型的预测不该跟着乱变。这个要求听起来温和，威力却极大，因为它把「数据增强」从提升泛化的小技巧，升格成了半监督的主引擎。这一篇讲清这条内在式路线：它如何把 <a href=\"../foundations/ssl-assumptions\">三大假设</a> 里的平滑性假设直接变成一个可微的损失，以及从 Π-model 到 UDA 这条方法链上每一步解决了什么问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把平滑性写成损失\">核心概念：把平滑性写成损失</h2><p>平滑性假设说「高密度区里相近的输入应有相近输出」。一致性正则的实现是：对无标签样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 施加一个保持语义的扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（噪声、增强、Dropout），要求扰动前后的预测分布尽量一致：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{cons} = \\frac{1}{u}\\sum_{x \\in D_u} d\\big(f(x),\\, f(\\tau(x))\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7159em;vertical-align:-1.3944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是某种距离，常用均方误差或 KL 散度。注意这里根本不需要知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的真实标签——损失只惩罚「预测的不一致」，无标签数据于是名正言顺地进了目标函数。下表列出这条方法链上的代表，各自的扰动来源和目标信号是理解它们差异的钥匙。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>扰动来源</th>\n<th>目标信号</th>\n<th>关键创新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Π-model</td>\n<td>两次随机增强 + Dropout</td>\n<td>同一网络另一次前向</td>\n<td>最朴素的双前向一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Temporal Ensembling</td>\n<td>单次增强</td>\n<td>历史预测的 EMA</td>\n<td>用时间平均稳住目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mean Teacher</td>\n<td>单次增强</td>\n<td>权重 EMA 教师的预测</td>\n<td>平均权重而非平均预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VAT</td>\n<td>对抗扰动方向</td>\n<td>原预测</td>\n<td>找最&quot;伤&quot;的扰动方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UDA</td>\n<td>强数据增强（RandAugment）</td>\n<td>弱增强的预测</td>\n<td>高级增强 + 弱强分工</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[无标签样本 x] --&gt; B[扰动分支 1]&#10;  A --&gt; C[扰动分支 2 或教师]&#10;  B --&gt; D[预测 f x1]&#10;  C --&gt; E[目标预测 f x2 stopgrad]&#10;  D --&gt; F[一致性距离 d]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[反传只更新学生分支]&#10;  G --&gt; H[平滑性假设被兑现]\">flowchart TD\n  A[无标签样本 x] --&gt; B[扰动分支 1]\n  A --&gt; C[扰动分支 2 或教师]\n  B --&gt; D[预测 f x1]\n  C --&gt; E[目标预测 f x2 stopgrad]\n  D --&gt; F[一致性距离 d]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[反传只更新学生分支]\n  G --&gt; H[平滑性假设被兑现]</pre><h2 id=\"从-model-到-temporal-ensembling-稳住目标\">从 Π-model 到 Temporal Ensembling：稳住目标</h2><p>最早的 Π-model（Laine &amp; Aila, 2017）做法直接：对同一样本做两次随机增强、两次带 Dropout 的前向，惩罚两次预测的差异。问题是两个分支都在动、都带噪声，目标本身抖得厉害，训练信号不稳。Temporal Ensembling 的改进是让「目标」安静下来——不拿另一次前向当目标，而是把该样本历史上所有轮次的预测做指数滑动平均（EMA），用这个时间平滑后的软标签当目标。平均掉了随机噪声，目标更可靠。</p>\n<p>它的缺陷是工程性的：得为每个样本存一份历史预测的累积，数据集一大内存吃紧，而且每个样本的目标一个 epoch 才更新一次，慢。这个瓶颈催生了 Mean Teacher。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mean-teacher-平均权重-而非平均预测\">Mean Teacher：平均权重，而非平均预测</h2><p>Mean Teacher（Tarvainen &amp; Valpola, NeurIPS 2017）换了个聪明角度：与其平均每个样本的历史预测，不如平均模型的权重。它维护两个网络——学生和教师，结构相同。学生正常用梯度下降更新；教师的权重则是学生权重的指数滑动平均，不接受梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{teacher}^{(t)} = \\alpha\\, \\theta_{teacher}^{(t-1)} + (1-\\alpha)\\, \\theta_{student}^{(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3461em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一致性损失要求学生对某样本的预测，逼近教师对同一样本（另一次增强）的预测。因为教师是权重平均的产物，它相当于一个「时间集成」的更稳模型，给出的目标质量更高、更新更及时（每步都在动），彻底摆脱了 Temporal Ensembling 的内存与延迟问题。教师—学生这套权重 EMA 结构影响极其深远，后来被自监督的 <a href=\"../../../ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/non-contrastive/byol-simsiam\">BYOL/SimSiam</a> 直接借用来防止表征坍缩，是跨越 SSL 与自监督两界的一块基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vat-与-uda-扰动方向的进化\">VAT 与 UDA：扰动方向的进化</h2><p>前面的方法扰动是随机的，VAT（Virtual Adversarial Training, Miyato et al.）提出一个更狠的问题：既然要模型对扰动鲁棒，何不专挑那个最能改变预测的「对抗方向」去扰动？它计算让预测分布变化最大的扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{adv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再要求模型对这个最坏扰动也保持一致：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{adv} = \\arg\\max_{\\|r\\|\\le\\epsilon} d\\big(f(x),\\, f(x+r)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.816em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∥</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这等于在决策边界最脆弱的方向上强行抹平，正则效果比随机扰动强得多，且不依赖领域特定的数据增强。</p>\n<p>UDA（Unsupervised Data Augmentation, Xie et al., 2019）则把赌注全押在增强质量上：它发现一致性正则的上限由「扰动」的质量决定，于是用 RandAugment、回译等高级增强替代简单噪声，并引入弱增强产目标、强增强来学的分工——弱增强预测当作可信目标（stop-gradient），强增强预测去逼近它。这个弱/强分工正是 <a href=\"holistic-methods\">综合方法</a> 里 FixMatch 的直接思想来源，也和 <a href=\"pseudo-labeling\">伪标签</a> 的弱强设计殊途同归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个共同陷阱-确认与坍缩\">一个共同陷阱：确认与坍缩</h2><p>一致性正则看似比伪标签安全（不造硬标签），却有自己的坑。目标预测由模型自己给出，如果模型早期就偏了，一致性会把这个偏见抹得到处都是——这仍是确认偏差的变体，详见 <a href=\"../practice/confirmation-bias\">确认偏差</a>。此外，如果没有监督损失牵引，纯一致性有一个平凡解：模型对所有输入输出同一个常数，一致性损失恒为零却毫无意义（表征坍缩）。防坍缩靠的正是有标签监督项的锚定，以及 stop-gradient、教师 EMA 这些不对称设计。理解这一点，你就明白为什么一致性损失永远是「监督损失 + 一致性损失」的加权和，而不能单独使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性正则不造标签，只要求预测对语义保持扰动免疫，是平滑性假设的直接兑现。</li>\n<li>Π-model → Temporal Ensembling → Mean Teacher 的主线是「如何让一致性目标更稳」：从双前向到时间平均预测，再到权重 EMA。</li>\n<li>VAT 用对抗方向扰动，UDA 用高级增强 + 弱/强分工，把一致性推到 SOTA 前夜。</li>\n<li>教师—学生权重 EMA 结构跨界影响了自监督方法。</li>\n<li>陷阱是确认偏差与表征坍缩，靠监督锚定和不对称设计（stop-gradient）来防。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"pseudo-labeling\">伪标签与自训练</a> 是互补的另一条路线；<a href=\"holistic-methods\">综合方法</a> 把一致性与伪标签融合成 FixMatch。</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../practice/confirmation-bias\">确认偏差</a> 解释一致性正则同样会踩的坑。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../../ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/non-contrastive/byol-simsiam\">BYOL/SimSiam</a> 直接继承 Mean Teacher 的教师—学生 EMA。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../../ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/regularization-techniques\">深度学习——正则化技术</a> 提供一致性所依赖的 Dropout、数据增强背景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Tarvainen &amp; Valpola, &quot;Mean Teachers&quot; (NeurIPS 2017)；Laine &amp; Aila, &quot;Temporal Ensembling&quot; (ICLR 2017)；Xie et al., &quot;Unsupervised Data Augmentation&quot; (NeurIPS 2020, arXiv:1904.12848)。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一致性正则：预测应对扰动免疫","id":"一致性正则-预测应对扰动免疫"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把平滑性写成损失","id":"核心概念-把平滑性写成损失"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Π-model 到 Temporal Ensembling：稳住目标","id":"从-model-到-temporal-ensembling-稳住目标"},{"level":2,"text":"Mean Teacher：平均权重，而非平均预测","id":"mean-teacher-平均权重-而非平均预测"},{"level":2,"text":"VAT 与 UDA：扰动方向的进化","id":"vat-与-uda-扰动方向的进化"},{"level":2,"text":"一个共同陷阱：确认与坍缩","id":"一个共同陷阱-确认与坍缩"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"伪标签与自训练：让模型给自己出题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/methods/pseudo-labeling"},"next":{"title":"综合方法：MixMatch、FixMatch 与 SOTA 的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/methods/holistic-methods"}}